{"id":"61df304a04864967","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-borel-relation.md","title":"Borel Relations Generated by Recursive Relations","display":"df-borel-relation — Borel Relations Generated by Recursive Relations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-borel-relation","aliases":["68-df-borel-relation"],"display":"df-borel-relation — Borel Relations Generated by Recursive Relations","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-recursive-real-relation]]","[[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§20 pp.76–77 / PDF 85–86","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-correspondence-and-generated-class-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-borel-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-borel-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-borel-relation — Borel Relations Generated by Recursive Relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab5b845cf7d367cd\" href=\"?note=ab5b845cf7d367cd\" title=\"68-df-recursive-real-relation\">68-df-recursive-real-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c689c9dc8aac6ab\" href=\"?note=9c689c9dc8aac6ab\" title=\"68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations\">68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§20 pp.76–77 / PDF 85–86"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-correspondence-and-generated-class-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{m,k}\">\\(X_{m,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab5b845cf7d367cd\" href=\"?note=ab5b845cf7d367cd\" title=\"68-df-recursive-real-relation\">68-df-recursive-real-relation</a> 中无固定外加实参数的递归关系类。生成算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X\">\\(\\sigma_X\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9c689c9dc8aac6ab\" href=\"?note=9c689c9dc8aac6ab\" title=\"68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations\">68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X_{m,k}\">\\(A\\subseteq X_{m,k}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}:=\\sigma_{X_{m,k}}(\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Borel}_{m,k}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}:=\\sigma_{X_{m,k}}(\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Borel}_{m,k}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>直接采用原书以递归关系生成最小 σ-ring 的定义。这里不额外依赖本库某个同名的拓扑 Borel 谓词，也不把 recursive in all reals 当作生成族；那会在纯数输入时直接得到所有集合，与原书此处构造的论证顺序不同。由递归关系的有效开闭性和基本柱集的递归性，可另比较通常的乘积拓扑 Borel 定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-real-relation","status":"resolved","id":"ab5b845cf7d367cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-real-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations","status":"resolved","id":"9c689c9dc8aac6ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]；$\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}$ 是 [[68-df-recursive-real-relation]] 中无固定外加实参数的递归关系类。生成算子 $\\sigma_X$ 见 [[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]。$A\\subseteq X_{m,k}$。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-real-relation","status":"resolved","id":"ab5b845cf7d367cd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]；$\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}$ 是 [[68-df-recursive-real-relation]] 中无固定外加实参数的递归关系类。生成算子 $\\sigma_X$ 见 [[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]。$A\\subseteq X_{m,k}$。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations","status":"resolved","id":"9c689c9dc8aac6ab","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]；$\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}$ 是 [[68-df-recursive-real-relation]] 中无固定外加实参数的递归关系类。生成算子 $\\sigma_X$ 见 [[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]。$A\\subseteq X_{m,k}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}:=\\sigma_{X_{m,k}}(\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}),\\qquad\\operatorname{Borel}_{m,k}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}.","display":true}],"bytes":1527,"backlinks":[{"id":"a8b8a34e241cffe0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$。$X_{0,k}=\\mathcal B^0\\times\\mathbb N^k$ 与 $\\mathbb N^k$ 通过 $((),\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\vec x$ 识别。粗体类见 [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]]，Borel 类见 [[68-df-borel-relation]]。"},{"id":"fb520eeb2ca8e0fc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 中，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X=X_{m,k}$；$A,B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(X)$。$\\mathrm{Borel}^{(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-borel-relation]]，$\\operatorname{Separates}_X$ 见 [[68-df-separation-of-relations]]。"},{"id":"2b92bd908c1baefd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"53a901d3f85d3dac","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-borel-relation]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-borel-relation]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-borel-relation|df-borel-relation — Borel Relations Generated by Recursive Relations]]"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","ab5b845cf7d367cd","9c689c9dc8aac6ab"]}